    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# CS - Duplicate ticket handler\n\nCalled fire-and-forget by \"CS - User eligibility check - first message\" when the incoming ticket is NOT the oldest active ticket for that requester.\n\n**Input:** project_key, keeper_ticket_id, loser_ticket_id\n\nMerges the loser into the keeper via POST /tickets/{keeper}/merge. Zendesk sets the loser to **closed** (permanent, not reopenable) and tags it closed_by_merge.\n\nBoth merge comments are **private** - the customer is not notified, and the keeper is not bumped out of its current status.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f71500f6-c123-4f27-bec9-a513a8db51f8",
      "name": "Sticky Note f503ee8c",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -336,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Safety re-checks (live)\n\nSkips the merge if any of these hold:\n- keeper or loser no longer active\n- different requesters\n- loser has an assignee\n- loser has a comment from anyone other than the requester or the automation agent\n\nThis makes the handler idempotent and safe to call from the scheduled sweep later.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e2d2366c-0ef6-4077-80cc-16ff9b409f9e",
      "name": "Sticky Note 341c4953",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The merge call\n\nBody is built in the Code node and serialised with JSON.stringify so ticket descriptions containing quotes or newlines cannot break the payload.\n\nMerge runs as a **background job** - the response is a job_status, not a finished merge. Poll job_status.url if you ever need confirmation.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "f65fbe2a-cb26-4837-9061-f351ab764e90",
      "name": "Sticky Note 8d841cd5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1424,
        -16
      ]
    }
